  "description": "T1 item 9 (testbenches shipped): the model KATs, the reuse check, the SHA-256, AES, DRBG, HMAC, key-ladder and TRNG-interface RTL benches (with their negative controls) and the P-7/P-8/P-9 formal run that back the results in verification/records/, and the one cold-start command that reproduces them. Three record sets are not covered and are named in scripts/cold-start-benches.sh: keyladder-formal (the FORMAL key-ladder bench, whose bounded runs exceed the 1800 s per-command limit of klt signoff --attest), smoke-synthesis-sim (retired; its bench is no longer in the tree) and independent-rerun (re-runs of the flows above, no bench of its own). The cold-start command needs a GitHub credential: the TRNG-interface bench fetches the sibling's RTL at its pinned commit with `gh api`. Correctness and format only; no security claim.",
